# git reads .mailmap from the WORKTREE ROOT only (or via mailmap.file /
# mailmap.blob, neither of which this repo configures). The copy that used to
# live at .github/.mailmap was therefore inert and was never filled; it is
# moved here and left empty on purpose.
#
# There is no alternate author address to map: one name, one address
# (Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>). A mailmap entry with an
# empty <> pair is a malformed mailmap rather than a harmless placeholder, so
# nothing is declared until there is something to declare.
#
# Add a line here if that changes, in git's own format:
#   Proper Name <proper@email> <commit@email>
